WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.422 --> 00:00:08.641
The rats will race.

2
00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:12.290
They will race for a rose.

3
00:00:14.082 --> 00:00:17.335
They will row in a raft.

4
00:00:19.107 --> 00:00:22.997
They will row down the river.

5
00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:28.880
They will read as fast as they can.

6
00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:33.990
They will read about rockets.

7
00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.500
They will run down the road.

8
00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.710
They will run up the hill.

9
00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:50.350
Then the race will be over!

10
00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:52.990
Who will be the winner?

11
00:00:55.706 --> 00:01:13.294
run
